[[2047,32,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply controlled by the ignition (INT)\nfor the check module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches pin 13 of the line protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; pins 2,\n5, 10, 12 and 14 are earthed.</p><p>The signal indicating that the seat belt\nis fastened reaches pin 4 of the check module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : this signal\nis then sent again from module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong><a href=\"#/3234310\">E4021</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure is signalled\nto pin 16 of module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              from the earth signal coming from\nthe sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>For all the other warning lights, refer\nto the diagrams relating to the components to which they refer.</p>"]]